cell.p:
Knaw = know, pp. 7, 30;
knawe, p. 21;
knawen = known, p. 29

Noat = note, pp. 7, 13, 28, 29;
noate, p. 28;
noates = notes, p. 29

Quhyte = white, p. 30;
quhiter, p. 30;
quhytest, p. 30

Syllab = syllable, pp. 14, 15, 16, 18, 21, 22;
syllabes, p. 8.
Ben Jonson spells this word syllabe in his English Grammar
